<title>FRANCE: Seita says Mixte further trims holding.</title>
<headline>Seita says Mixte further trims holding.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Navigation Mixte has sold half of the 0.75  percent core holding it had taken in tobacco group Seita when the  latter was privatised, Seita said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Earlier this week Navigation Mixte sold half of its 1.5 percent core  stake. The sale reported on Friday cuts the 0.75 percent which remained  by 0.38 percentage points, according to the Seita statement.</p>
<p>Seita core shareholders have 25.57 percent of the group's capital,  Seita said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 bfl</p>
</text>
